  /// GitHub's `mergeable` (issue #88): `MERGEABLE` → `true`, `CONFLICTING` → `false`, `UNKNOWN`
  /// / absent → `nil` (also "not yet probed"). `nil`/`false` hides the Merge button. Optional with
